<ScenContainer xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <ScenTitle>Flight Tutorial 7 - AAW 5 CoW - Russian and Chinese Modern Weapons</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: IT'&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: IT; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin'&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: IT; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin'&gt;Hello and welcome to the Flight Tutorial.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: IT; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin'&gt;This is the seventh&amp;nbsp;in a series of tutorials designed to teach players the fundamentals of airplane operations in CMANO. In this tutorial, the following topics will be covered:&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;UL type=disc&gt;
&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: IT; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin'&gt;Operation of Russian and Chinese modern missiles.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: IT; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin'&gt;Operation of stealth airplanes.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: IT; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin'&gt;Engaging enemy airborne HVT (High Value Targets).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: IT; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin'&gt;Engaging enemy airplanes armed with modern long-range missiles.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/UL&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: IT; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin'&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: IT; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin'&gt;Created by Andrea D., a.k.a. SirAndrew&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
